timedated: timedated (timedate daemon for org.freedesktop.timedate1)
timedated:
timedated: timedated is a system service that controls the system time and
timedated: related settings. It implements the org.freedesktop.timedate1
timedated: D-Bus interface as a drop-in replacement for systemd-timedated,
timedated: for use on systems without systemd.
timedated:
timedated: It supports PolKit authentication and NTP daemon control via
timedated: Slackware's rc.ntpd script.
timedated: Fork: https://github.com/rizitis/timedated
